      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-04-18",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to a previous order of the House of April 10, 2023, the unfinished business is the further consideration of the veto message of the President on H.J.Res. 27. The House proceeded with one hour of debate on the objection of the President to the contrary notwithstanding. (consideration: CR H1782-1789)",
      "time": "14:13:00",
